  "officialHtml": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/puc200.html",
  "prefLabel": "Puc 204.08 Intervention",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 204.08 Intervention. The intervention process shall be as follows:\n\n(a) Requests to intervene shall be in the form of a petition, in which the petitioner states the reasons why intervention in a specific docket should be granted;\n\n(b) The commission shall rule on petitions to intervene in accordance with the standards of RSA 541-A:32; and\n\n(c) In exercising its discretion under RSA 541-A:32, II, the commission shall consider whether the intervention will impair the orderly and prompt conduct of the proceedings.\n\nSource. #14184, eff 1-24-25 (formerly Puc 203.17)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/puc200.html"
